{"seq":1,"slug":"versioning-strategy","title":"版本策略","docCount":3,"url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/versioning-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"semver-calver-practices","title":"语义化版本与日历版本","url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/versioning-strategy/semver-calver-practices","wordCount":1511,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"branching-release-models","title":"分支与发布模型","url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/versioning-strategy/branching-release-models","wordCount":1433,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"changelog-release-notes","title":"变更日志与发布说明","url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/versioning-strategy/changelog-release-notes","wordCount":1349,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 版本策略\n\n版本号是软件制品面向消费者的第一份承诺。选择怎样的编号方案、采用何种分支模型来支撑它、以及如何把变更历史结构化地传达给下游——这三件事共同构成了发布工程的版本策略层。\n\n本章从语义化版本（SemVer）与日历版本（CalVer）的适用场景对比入手，继而讨论支撑不同发布节奏的分支与发布模型，最后落到变更日志的自动生成与发布说明的最佳实践。三篇文档分别回答\"版本号怎么定\"、\"代码流怎么走\"、\"历史怎么写\"。\n"}